03615d05|4|May, 2024|100|1|H|Nice product|After researching so many Boat Earbuds for a week, here is my honest review for Boat Airdopes 163 TWS :- 1- Look and Design Look and design is above average as it It looks premium on hands and Its size is also enough compact to be easily handled on pockets 2- Bass If you are a Bass lover and wants a high bass experience in your music then this product Airdopes 161/163 is definitely for you just without searching much go and buy it believe me  you will never regret for its bass quality because it provides a very good boomy bass in music with boat signature sounds. 3- Overall Sound Quality If we talk about overall sound quality than it is great for music lovers however trebles are little lower side but the bass is amazing so music lover are definitely going to like its sound Quality. 4- Battery Backup My experience with battery backup is also very good as I have an average use of buds for study and listening so I have an avg use of buds for daily 4 hrs. On a single charge I have spent 5 days with my buds using them on and avg of 4 hours daily. So battery backup is also very good. ( Negative comments are for Airdopes 161pro model ) 5-Gaming Remember the Airdopes 161/163 is very good for listening music but not for gaming at all As it doesn't comes with any dedicated gaming mode. 6- Calling Quality I have used the buds for calling also and I have never feel as such issue in noise cancellation etc. Simply calling quality is also decent. Overall Review - I have ordered Airdopes 161/163 buds after previously using and returning Airdopes 161pro buds because on those there was very low base and not a good sound quality. So believe me If you are a music lover go and buy them you will definitely not regret on enjoying music with these buds. Note - Above mentioned review is based on my personal user experience only. Thank you❤️ Put a Like for the efforts 👍🏼
