b3f5a664|5|Jan, 2022|16|1|H|Super!|Received this sound bar on promised date. The soundbar is basic but powerful. The bass and treble is just enough to experience movies, OTT content and so as music.  The available connectivity options as more than enough for a normal user. I tried Bluetooth, HDMI arc, usb & Aux, they are just flawless.  The look and finish is classic, Remote has all the buttons you need and bass treble can be controlled through this along with volume, mode & inputs.  It's just you get a feeling of this bar could have had a display instead of a single led on the  right which changes the color according to the mode you are connecting with.  You will get an Aux cable, wall mounting support, screws & an adaptor to connect to a power source. This one does not have a battery so needs power connection. Just to share, if you want very good punchy bass, go for Boat 1500/1550 over this one but after sales service is so poor from them. Do check out for offers and dynamic pricing on this product as I got mine for as low as 2268. About Flipkart and Open box delivery service, They delivered as promised but no extra packaging used as the soundbar came with it's own packaging and no covering used by Flipkart.  Also, they promise OBD on these products but most of the delivery guys doesn't even aware what OBD is & they deny to open product as they don't want to take any risk.  Overall Happy with the purchase as this serves my purpose to improve my TV sound capabilities an audio experience.
