6ed9c107|5|Apr, 2022|931|1|H|Highly recommended|If anybody is planning to add a soundbar to their smart tv, just close your eyes and go for it. Packaging was really cute and open box delivery by delivery agent was a nice experience. However HDMI arc is not available in S60, but other options like 3.5 mm audio in, COAX, and offcourse bluetooth works like charm. I have connected it to my 43 inch smart tv via bluetooth. Sound quality is crisp and clear. Bass is optimum, but not for heavy bass lovers. 3 equalizer modes available but i could not find much difference in sound in different modes. However music mode is my best option which provides good sound along with bass. Sound quality did not distort or cracked even at high volumes. Remote is quite simple and does the job. If u are connecting to a device which have dolby atmos then i would recommend connecting soundbar via bluetooth option to have the dolby atmos effect output as dolby atmos is not available in speaker. it comes with an option to wall mount as well as table top Final verdict : value for money. compared to other soundbar in this price bracket Mivi Fort S60 is best option. Its been only 2 days of usage and performance is upto my satisfaction will wait and see for the performance in a long go
4b1c365d|5|Jun, 2022|113|1|H|Simply awesome|After 21 days of extensive usage, i am writing this review.. Changing from 4 starts to 5.. At first i thought the sound quality was just average, clarity was good.. But after 10 days of burning those speakers,  they started showing their real quality. The clarity is great, the bass is good.. Music mode is the best for surround sound kinda feeling. Connectivity is good, it connects fast with my tv, and mobile. You can hear the dialogues of movies quite clearly  and its impressive. Loudness is good for large size personal room. Not for a big hall. Overall Mivi did a great job. One suggestion - Listen to 8D songs.
