d38fbed4|5|May, 2022|3|1|H|Simply fabulous!|After a lot of thinking, I bought this product in July 2021. Here's a detailed review after 10 months of usage: Where do I even start? Of course with the mouse! Mouse: The mouse is so lightweight. The click feedback is just about right. Carries a single AA battery. Unbelievable battery life! 10 months on and it's still going strong. Everything is great about this piece. Not your fancy gaming mouse, but perfect for day-to-day tasks. 5/5. Keyboard: The keyboard felt a bit long initially, but you get used to it. The height adjustment comes in handy during long periods of use. Again great battery life. Carries 2 AAA batteries. Haven't changed the battery since I started using it. Sturdy keys. Minor drawbacks include: No capslock light, no brightness adjustment key and no power off button - but hey, the battery life is simply amazing. 4/5 Verdict: Highly recommended for casual use. The best part is of course the battery life. In fact, I had to check the pieces for the number of batteries they carry while writing this review! You will probably forget about the batteries too.
